{"step_index":447,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-25T11:57:51Z","input_tokens":2458,"cache_read_tokens":204649,"output_tokens":1151,"thinking":"The plan is to integrate the Phase 2 and Phase 3 CSS styles related to the variable box cards into the application's stylesheet. Specifically, this involves defining styles for the `.var-boxes-grid` container, individual `.var-box-card` elements (including borders, backgrounds, and positioning), and the `.var-box-label`, `.var-box-val-slot`, and `.var-box-value` components.\n\n\n**Consideration of the specific visual elements defined for variable box updates, including previous value indicators, update animations, and negative value warnings.** **Analysis of the number moving animation, step-by-step calculation stage, negative reset warnings, and condition gate visual structures for integration.**\n\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\app_build\\styles.css","EndLine":730,"StartLine":715,"toolAction":"Viewing insertion point in styles.css","toolSummary":"View styles.css lines 715-730"}}]}
